/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 411 0 R
/T (There are three main aspects of education viz. imparting information, its practical application and the ideal unto which the acquired knowledge should be dedicated. That system of education which does not prepare its students to live their life in its totality is incomplete indeed.  Academic excellence is important but it should be accompanied with the inner unfoldment of the student's personality as well. Or else, it would be a lopsided development defeating the  very purpose of education. Param Poojya Gurudev gave us His Vision of perfect education and now it is our responsibility to work for its total fulfillment. I am aware of the great work being done in all Chinmaya Vidyalayas and I congratulate them for the same. My special thanks to all teachers and Principals without whose dedication the Vidyalayas could not have achieved this excellence. May Poojya Gurudev's blessings ever strengthen us to fulfil His vision.)
/E (There are three main aspects of education viz. imparting information, its practical application and the ideal unto which the acquired knowledge should be dedicated. That system of education which does not prepare its students to live their life in its totality is incomplete indeed.  Academic excellence is important but it should be accompanied with the inner unfoldment of the student's personality as well. Or else, it would be a lopsided development defeating the  very purpose of education. Param Poojya Gurudev gave us His Vision of perfect education and now it is our responsibility to work for its total fulfillment. I am aware of the great work being done in all Chinmaya Vidyalayas and I congratulate them for the same. My special thanks to all teachers and Principals without whose dedication the Vidyalayas could not have achieved this excellence. May Poojya Gurudev's blessings ever strengthen us to fulfil His vision.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [1]
>>
