/T (Education at Chinmaya Vidyalaya is not limited to academic excellence alone. We strive to nurture disciplined, confident, compassionate, and responsible individuals who are rooted in Indian culture while being equipped to face global challenges. The Chinmaya Vision Programme guides our approach by integrating knowledge, devotion, and selfless action into everyday learning.  )
