/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 419 0 R
/T (We the children of Bharat sing together in one voice despite the difference in us. Chinmaya Vidyalaya will bring out  uniqueness and oneness  We light the lamp of dedication to work , love and compassion . We will impart humanity and tolerance . We will remove superstitious belief and illiteracy  We will build a society which is highly civilised  We will spread the greatness of devotion , knowledge and respect for one and all . We will bring about the changes in lightening  speed amongst us . We sow the golden seed of universal welfare  We will spread out the concept - the whole wolrd is one family . Let us keep smiling and illuminate our Indian culture.)
/E (We the children of Bharat sing together in one voice despite the difference in us. Chinmaya Vidyalaya will bring out  uniqueness and oneness  We light the lamp of dedication to work , love and compassion . We will impart humanity and tolerance . We will remove superstitious belief and illiteracy  We will build a society which is highly civilised  We will spread the greatness of devotion , knowledge and respect for one and all . We will bring about the changes in lightening  speed amongst us . We sow the golden seed of universal welfare  We will spread out the concept - the whole wolrd is one family . Let us keep smiling and illuminate our Indian culture.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [0]
>>
